 ; Theory: BLSSignatureInstance.v requires Theory.BLS12Pairing.*, which used
 ; to live in this theory as Spec.BLS12Pairing.*.  That placement was a
 ; dependency cycle -- this theory depends on Bedrock, and eighteen Bedrock
